# w.drawing/shards/words: the owned English vocabulary, separate from the schema.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written declarations); pro-formaliser b5e5bd7 (the twelve
# sop-worlds/pro.reader/grouped-effects.sop weather value words, INTEGRATE-4, owner-authorized)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written)
